    <string name="main_run_info_body">Average pace uses active time. Replay and splits use GPS time, skipping pauses and gaps over 15 seconds. Speed is a five-second GPS estimate. Replay climb and descent use terrain maps with a 3 m noise threshold. Exports retain original GPS heights. Missing measurements show —.</string>
