    <string name="main_direction">GPS direction</string>
    <string name="main_direction_body">The arrow follows your movement. Move outdoors to establish a heading. While stopped, it keeps the last known direction. Drag to explore; tap the location button to follow again.</string>
    <string name="main_about_body">Your recordings stay on this phone. Maps request visible-area tiles from EOX and IGN. Export important activities before uninstalling.\n\nMap attribution appears on the map. Icons: Tabler · MIT license.</string>
    <string name="main_icon_license">Icon license</string>
    <string name="main_protection_body">Battery: %1$s\nNotifications: %2$s\n\nScreen off or app swiped away: recording continues while Android permits. After shutdown or force-stop: reopen to recover saved data.\n\nFor long activities, allow unrestricted battery use.\n\nAllow Runline and silent notifications on the lock screen. Expand the notification for controls. Samsung Now Bar support depends on your phone and One UI version.</string>
